               <rdf:li rdf:parseType="Resource">
                  <photoshop:LayerName>Hi, my name is Sam Miller. I am the Operations Manager here at </photoshop:LayerName>
                  <photoshop:LayerText>Hi, my name is Sam Miller. I am the Operations Manager here at Asset Recuperation, Inc. While our primary emphasis is on power systems and industrial machinery, we are always looking for new opportunities in new sectors. We maintain a large inventory including:  Boilers, Chillers, Generators, Compressors, Cooling Towers, and numerous other types of Manufacturing Equipment. Feel free to visit our website for a complete listing of our products and services.</photoshop:LayerText>
               </rdf:li>
               <rdf:li rdf:parseType="Resource">
                  <photoshop:LayerName>You have it, we buy it! Call 888.876.3991 for a quote today.</photoshop:LayerName>
                  <photoshop:LayerText>You have it, we buy it! Call 888.876.3991 for a quote today.</photoshop:LayerText>
               </rdf:li>
               <rdf:li rdf:parseType="Resource">
                  <photoshop:LayerName>We also offer a host of additional services which many contract</photoshop:LayerName>
                  <photoshop:LayerText>We also offer a host of additional services which many contractors and property managers have come to depend on us for, such as: Auction Services, Removal and Dismantlement, Electrical Disconnects, Equipment Appraisal, Transportation and Storage.</photoshop:LayerText>
               </rdf:li>
